00:21:01.968 --> 00:21:04.488
Slight paraphrasing, but that's how it relates to debt collection.

403
00:21:05.548 --> 00:21:08.188
There's very little case law on Section 23 and what it means.

404
00:21:08.988 --> 00:21:11.548
So I'm asking that the Fair Trading Act be amended

405
00:21:12.408 --> 00:21:15.888
