419
00:22:05.028 --> 00:22:08.698
So and the case has established that there is a difference between harassment and

420
00:22:08.748 --> 00:22:11.888
coercion and undue harassment and coercion.

421
00:22:12.568 --> 00:22:16.508
So if Section 23 was amended in this way to insert one word, undue,

422
00:22:16.588 --> 00:22:20.388
that would align our law with Australia and enable the development of

423
00:22:20.448 --> 00:22:23.768
these New Zealand guidelines around debt collection practices.

